turns.content:
I have not made any decision about your mother’s debt. I declined to draft a legally unsupported claim. A transfer order can support an urgent status challenge, but it does not itself prove inpatient admission.

Before transfer, request written confirmation from the hospital and SNF of:

- her official status and every status order’s date and time;
- the payer’s coverage authorization;
- the expected daily out-of-pocket charge;
- the utilization-review decision and available expedited appeal route.

My recommendation remains: contest observation status using the clinical record and signed transfer order, without claiming the order automatically established inpatient status.
